## 🎯 Build Reference — Evil Gilberton (Pyro/Dex)

### Stats Iniciais (Pyromancer)
| Stat | Valor Base | Notas |
|------|------------|-------|
| Vitality | 12 | HP |
| Attunement | 12 | 1 slot (Fireball) |
| Endurance | 11 | Stamina/Equip Load |
| Strength | 12 | Req. armas |
| **Dexterity** | **10 → 12** | **Upado Ep.01 para Rapier** |
| Resistance | 10 | |
| Intelligence | 10 | |
| Faith | 8 | |

### Progressão Planejada (Baseada no Vídeo)
- **Dex:** 12 → 14 → 16... (Rapier, Uchigatana, Scimitar, Great Scythe)
- **Attunement:** 12 → 14 (2 slots) → 16 (3 slots) → 19 (4 slots) → 23 (5 slots)
- **Vitality/Endurance:** Conforme necessidade de survivability e equip load
- **Intelligence:** Só se for usar sorceries (não é o foco)

### Pyromancies Alvo (Ordem de Aquisição)
1. ✅ **Fireball** (inicial)
2. 🔜 **Fire Orb** / **Great Fireball** (Laurentius / Quelana)
3. 🔜 **Combustion** / **Great Combustion** (curto alcance, alto dano)
4. 🔜 **Fire Tempest** / **Chaos Storm** (endgame)
5. 🔜 **Power Within** (buff de dano + drena HP)
6. 🔜 **Iron Flesh** (defesa massiva, movimento lento)

### Armas Principais (Dex)
| Arma | Req. Dex | Onde Pegar | Status |
|------|----------|------------|--------|
| **Rapier** | 12 | Undead Burg (comprado/achado) | ✅ Equipada |
| **Uchigatana** | 14 | Undead Merchant (drop se matar) | ❓ Decisão pendente |
| **Scimitar** | 14 | Undead Merchant (600 almas) | 💰 Comprada Ep.01 |
| **Great Scythe** | 16 | Catacombs (drop) | ⏳ Futuro |
| **Balder Side Sword** | 14 | Balder Knights (drop raro) | ⏳ Farm opcional |

### Equipamentos-Chave
| Slot | Item Atual | Upgrade Alvo |
|------|------------|--------------|
| **Shield** | Caduceus Kite Shield (+0) | +10 / Silver Knight Shield / Grass Crest Shield |
| **Pyro Flame** | Pyromancy Flame (+0) | +15 → Ascended (+5) |
| **Ring 1** | Tiny Being's Ring | Havel's Ring / Ring of FAP / Wolf Ring |
| **Ring 2** | — | Bellowing Dragoncrest / Red Tearstone / Hornet Ring |

